    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "73(3) 1  Offence of people smuggling",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a01078#sch-1-sec-73-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2004a01078.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2004a01078.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this Code, an offence against subsection (1) is\nto be known as the offence of people smuggling.\n\nPeople smuggling  Schedule 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (People Smuggling, Firearms Trafficking and Other Measures)",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of this Code, an offence against subsection (1) is\nto be known as the offence of people smuggling.\n\nPeople smuggling  Schedule 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (People Smuggling, Firearms Trafficking and Other Measures)",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
