      },
      "dc:source": "c2004a01078.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "slavery has the same meaning as in Division 270.\nthreat means:\n\n(a) a threat of force; or\n\n(b) a threat to cause a person’s deportation; or\n\n(c) a threat of any other detrimental action unless there are\nreasonable grounds for the threat of that action in connection\nwith the provision of labour or services by a person.",
      "skos:definition": "slavery has the same meaning as in Division 270.\nthreat means:\n\n(a) a threat of force; or\n\n(b) a threat to cause a person’s deportation; or\n\n(c) a threat of any other detrimental action unless there are\nreasonable grounds for the threat of that action in connection\nwith the provision of labour or services by a person.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-6-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-6-logic-alleninterval-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-6-logic-ltl-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-6-logic-diffusion-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-6-logic-cogai-6"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "495b3d298cefb33e8f42bd58f14ff43b320b3f0c809030a1c40ddcb3bd7e0647",
      "skos:note": "Definition of threat in people smuggling legislation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a01078#sch-1-sec-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 Crimes Legislation Amendment (People Smuggling, Firearms Trafficking and Other",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "slavery has the same meaning as in Division 270.\nthreat means:\n\n(a) a threat of force; or\n\n(b) a threat to cause a person’s deportation; or\n\n(c) a threat of any other detrimental action unless there are\nreasonable grounds for the threat of that action in connection\nwith the provision of labour or services by a person."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-6-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
