    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "73 6  Meaning of travel or identity document",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a01078#sch-1-sec-73-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2004a01078.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2004a01078.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Subdivision, a document is a travel or\nidentity document if it is:\n\n(a) a travel document; or\n\n(b) an identity document.\n\n(2) In subsection (1):\nidentity document includes any kind of document that may be used\nto establish the identity of a person in a country under the law or\nprocedures of that country.\ntravel document includes any kind of document required, under the\nlaw of a country, to enter or leave that country.\n\nSchedule 1  People smuggling",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Subdivision, a document is a travel or\nidentity document if it is:\n\n(a) a travel document; or\n\n(b) an identity document.\n\n(2) In subsection (1):\nidentity document includes any kind of document that may be used\nto establish the identity of a person in a country under the law or\nprocedures of that country.\ntravel document includes any kind of document required, under the\nlaw of a country, to enter or leave that country.\n\nSchedule 1  People smuggling",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-6-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-6-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2253fc42494a34bf4101a963519f149224b8928b68d89386392346d4fa747174"
    },
