      "dc:source": "c2004a01078.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this Subdivision, a person is taken to make a\nfalse travel or identity document if the person alters a document so\nas to make it a false travel or identity document (whether or not it\nwas already a false travel or identity document before the\nalteration).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of this Subdivision, a person is taken to make a\nfalse travel or identity document if the person alters a document so\nas to make it a false travel or identity document (whether or not it\nwas already a false travel or identity document before the\nalteration).",
