      "skos:definition": "(3) This section has effect as if a document that purports to be a true\ncopy of another document were the original document.\n\nPeople smuggling  Schedule 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (People Smuggling, Firearms Trafficking and Other Measures)",
      "values:partOf": {
