    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "73 8  Making, providing or possessing a false travel or identity",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a01078#sch-1-sec-73-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2004a01078.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2004a01078.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "document\n\nA person (the first person) is guilty of an offence if:\n\n(a) the first person makes, provides or possesses a false travel or\nidentity document; and\n\n(b) the first person intends that the document will be used to\nfacilitate the entry of another person (the other person) into a\nforeign country, where the entry of the other person into the\nforeign country would not comply with the requirements\nunder that country’s law for entry into the country; and\n\n(c) the first person made, provided or possessed the document:\n\n(i) having obtained (whether directly or indirectly) a\nbenefit to do so; or\n\n(ii) with the intention of obtaining (whether directly or\nindirectly) a benefit.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 10 years or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth.",
      "skos:definition": "document\n\nA person (the first person) is guilty of an offence if:\n\n(a) the first person makes, provides or possesses a false travel or\nidentity document; and\n\n(b) the first person intends that the document will be used to\nfacilitate the entry of another person (the other person) into a\nforeign country, where the entry of the other person into the\nforeign country would not comply with the requirements\nunder that country’s law for entry into the country; and\n\n(c) the first person made, provided or possessed the document:\n\n(i) having obtained (whether directly or indirectly) a\nbenefit to do so; or\n\n(ii) with the intention of obtaining (whether directly or\nindirectly) a benefit.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 10 years or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "db9f0769f74b1ee20a20e1f86fd7264a6ddab4fe1cf24f9534bdbfcf6b147120",
      "skos:note": "Possessing a false travel or identity document to facilitate another person's entry into a foreign country is prohibited."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a01078#sch-1-sec-73-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "73 8  Making, providing or possessing a false travel or identity",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 13,
      "values:originalText": "document\n\nA person (the first person) is guilty of an offence if:\n\n(a) the first person makes, provides or possesses a false travel or\nidentity document; and\n\n(b) the first person intends that the document will be used to\nfacilitate the entry of another person (the other person) into a\nforeign country, where the entry of the other person into the\nforeign country would not comply with the requirements\nunder that country’s law for entry into the country; and\n\n(c) the first person made, provided or possessed the document:\n\n(i) having obtained (whether directly or indirectly) a\nbenefit to do so; or\n\n(ii) with the intention of obtaining (whether directly or\nindirectly) a benefit.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 10 years or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-8-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
