      "dc:source": "c2004a01078.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "Section 15.2 (extended geographical jurisdiction—category B)\napplies to an offence against this Subdivision.\n\nSchedule 2  Cross-border firearms trafficking",
      "skos:definition": "Section 15.2 (extended geographical jurisdiction—category B)\napplies to an offence against this Subdivision.\n\nSchedule 2  Cross-border firearms trafficking",
