    {
      "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-2-sec-360",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360 1  Disposal and acquisition of a firearm",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a01078#sch-2-sec-360"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2004a01078.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2004a01078.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Division, and without limitation, a person\ndisposes of a firearm if any of the following applies:\n\n(a) the person sells the firearm (whether or not the person to\nwhom the firearm is sold also acquires physical control of the\nfirearm);\n\n(b) the person hires, leases or rents the firearm to another person;\n\n(c) the person passes physical control of the firearm to another\nperson (whether or not the person to whom physical control\nis passed also acquires ownership of the firearm).\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Division, and without limitation, a person\nacquires a firearm if any of the following applies:\n\n(a) the person purchases the firearm (whether or not the person\nalso acquires physical control of the firearm);\n\n(b) the person hires, leases or rents the firearm from another\nperson;\n\n(c) the person obtains physical control of the firearm (whether or\nnot the person also acquires ownership of the firearm).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Division, and without limitation, a person\ndisposes of a firearm if any of the following applies:\n\n(a) the person sells the firearm (whether or not the person to\nwhom the firearm is sold also acquires physical control of the\nfirearm);\n\n(b) the person hires, leases or rents the firearm to another person;\n\n(c) the person passes physical control of the firearm to another\nperson (whether or not the person to whom physical control\nis passed also acquires ownership of the firearm).\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Division, and without limitation, a person\nacquires a firearm if any of the following applies:\n\n(a) the person purchases the firearm (whether or not the person\nalso acquires physical control of the firearm);\n\n(b) the person hires, leases or rents the firearm from another\nperson;\n\n(c) the person obtains physical control of the firearm (whether or\nnot the person also acquires ownership of the firearm).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-2-sec-360-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-2-sec-360-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "74a503a87a9c54296e738310a7e434e88283a442534f70e1c50afdd619692121"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a01078#sch-2-sec-360",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360 1  Disposal and acquisition of a firearm",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Division, and without limitation, a person\ndisposes of a firearm if any of the following applies:\n\n(a) the person sells the firearm (whether or not the person to\nwhom the firearm is sold also acquires physical control of the\nfirearm);\n\n(b) the person hires, leases or rents the firearm to another person;\n\n(c) the person passes physical control of the firearm to another\nperson (whether or not the person to whom physical control\nis passed also acquires ownership of the firearm).\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Division, and without limitation, a person\nacquires a firearm if any of the following applies:\n\n(a) the person purchases the firearm (whether or not the person\nalso acquires physical control of the firearm);\n\n(b) the person hires, leases or rents the firearm from another\nperson;\n\n(c) the person obtains physical control of the firearm (whether or\nnot the person also acquires ownership of the firearm)."
    },
    {
