      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Division, and without limitation, a person\ndisposes of a firearm if any of the following applies:\n\n(a) the person sells the firearm (whether or not the person to\nwhom the firearm is sold also acquires physical control of the\nfirearm);\n\n(b) the person hires, leases or rents the firearm to another person;\n\n(c) the person passes physical control of the firearm to another\nperson (whether or not the person to whom physical control\nis passed also acquires ownership of the firearm).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Division, and without limitation, a person\ndisposes of a firearm if any of the following applies:\n\n(a) the person sells the firearm (whether or not the person to\nwhom the firearm is sold also acquires physical control of the\nfirearm);\n\n(b) the person hires, leases or rents the firearm to another person;\n\n(c) the person passes physical control of the firearm to another\nperson (whether or not the person to whom physical control\nis passed also acquires ownership of the firearm).",
