      "skos:prefLabel": "360(2) 1  Disposal and acquisition of a firearm",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a01078#sch-2-sec-360-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2004a01078.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2004a01078.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this Division, and without limitation, a person\nacquires a firearm if any of the following applies:\n\n(a) the person purchases the firearm (whether or not the person\nalso acquires physical control of the firearm);\n\n(b) the person hires, leases or rents the firearm from another\nperson;\n\n(c) the person obtains physical control of the firearm (whether or\nnot the person also acquires ownership of the firearm).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of this Division, and without limitation, a person\nacquires a firearm if any of the following applies:\n\n(a) the person purchases the firearm (whether or not the person\nalso acquires physical control of the firearm);\n\n(b) the person hires, leases or rents the firearm from another\nperson;\n\n(c) the person obtains physical control of the firearm (whether or\nnot the person also acquires ownership of the firearm).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-2-sec-360"
      },
