      "cml:integrityHash": "f5d60e857e81cce0da4398bc477bfee0587cace55fc8975afcf4d0da6afe44c5",
      "skos:note": "Definition of firearm law"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2004a01078#sch-2-sec-360-2-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360(3) 2  Cross-border offence of disposal or acquisition of a firearm",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "(3) In this section:\nfirearm means a firearm within the meaning of the firearm law\nconcerned.\nfirearm law means a law of a State or Territory which is prescribed\nby the regulations for the purposes of this Division."
    },
    {
