      "dc:source": "c2004a01078.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "This Division is not intended to exclude or limit the concurrent\noperation of any law of a State or Territory.\n\nOther measures  Schedule 3\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (People Smuggling, Firearms Trafficking and Other Measures)",
      "skos:definition": "This Division is not intended to exclude or limit the concurrent\noperation of any law of a State or Territory.\n\nOther measures  Schedule 3\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (People Smuggling, Firearms Trafficking and Other Measures)",
      "cml:asserts": [
