      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) A person is guilty of an offence if:\n\n(a) the person obtains a financial advantage for another person\nfrom a third person, knowing or believing that the other\nperson is not eligible to receive that financial advantage;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Imprisonment for 12 months."
    },
