      "dc:source": "c2004a01078.pdf, p.23",
      "values:originalText": "cash dealer)\nInsert:\n\n(l) a person (other than a financial institution or a real estate\nagent acting in the ordinary course of real estate business)\nwho carries on a business in Australia of:\n\n(i) on behalf of other persons, arranging for funds to be\nmade available outside Australia to those persons or\nothers; or\n\n(ii) on behalf of persons outside Australia, making funds\navailable, or arranging for funds to be made available,\nin Australia to those persons or others;",
      "skos:definition": "cash dealer)\nInsert:\n\n(l) a person (other than a financial institution or a real estate\nagent acting in the ordinary course of real estate business)\nwho carries on a business in Australia of:\n\n(i) on behalf of other persons, arranging for funds to be\nmade available outside Australia to those persons or\nothers; or\n\n(ii) on behalf of persons outside Australia, making funds\navailable, or arranging for funds to be made available,\nin Australia to those persons or others;",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2004a01078-sch-3-sec-22-norm"
        },
